---
import Eyebrow from './Eyebrow.astro';
---
<section class="section overflow-hidden bg-surface">
  <div class="container-x relative grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-12 md:items-center">
    <div class="md:col-span-7">
      <Eyebrow num="02" label="The approach" />
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-[18ch] text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,5.25rem)] font-medium leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.04em]" data-scrub>
        Good websites are clear, useful and made to last.
      </p>
      <p class="lead mt-10 max-w-[52ch]" data-reveal>
        We keep the process focused: understand the business, establish the direction, design the experience and build the final site. Modern tools help us work efficiently without compromising the result.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <div class="render-stage" data-tilt-zone>
        <div class="render-stage__device" data-device="layers" data-variant="stack3" data-motion="explode" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
